In the original Zork, there was a Book of the Dead which mentioned how
certain lights, sounds, and prayers were effective in dispelling the dead.
One room contained the gates of hell.  If you tried to pass the gates,
dead spirits would stop you.  To get past them, you had to light a candle,
ring a bell, and read the book.

Sounds like the 3.1 ritual is a reference to Zork I.

